🛠 Usage Examples

@add_context notes.md
@grab https://example.com
@summary
@copy 105
@run 110


⸻

📁 Configuration

Edit ~/.config/chatui/settings.ini:

[model_ollama]
model_name = llama3
max_tokens = 2048
stream = true

[general]
max_file_load_size_kb = 100


